WEBVTT

00:00:00.630 --> 00:00:05.970
<i>Everyone is searching for a new world</i>

00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:12.070
<i>to attain that overflowing dream.</i>

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:17.650
<i>They all jump over the horizon,</i>

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:26.420
<i>regardless of what lies beyond.</i>

00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:34.160
<i>We've run,</i>

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:36.630
<i>we've dived into hope,</i>

00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:39.500
<i>and forgotten only courage.</i>

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:44.240
<i>And we've been swept away by the crowd</i>

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:48.900
<i>only to lose something dear to us.</i>

00:00:52.210 --> 00:00:54.580
<i>I smile with a twisted face,</i>

00:00:54.580 --> 00:01:01.250
<i>and it was the best smile I could put on.</i>

00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:04.630
<i>The inside of my mask overflowed with tears</i>

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:12.270
<i>so I covered my wet mask
with yet another mask.</i>

00:01:12.270 --> 00:01:17.170
<i>I continue to walk through
the flat battleground,</i>

00:01:17.170 --> 00:01:22.410
<i>and I struggle, unable to warp.</i>

00:01:22.410 --> 00:01:32.520
<i>The dream waits quietly on a cape far away.</i>

00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:37.260
<i>Even if I fumble around clumsily,</i>

00:01:37.260 --> 00:01:41.990
<i>I'm sure I'll still be
able to make it there.</i>

00:02:00.040 --> 00:02:05.030
The Lamenting Angel

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:27.360
You're gonna catch a cold.

00:02:29.430 --> 00:02:31.670
Thanks for the warning.

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:35.200
In return, I have a warning for you.

00:02:35.870 --> 00:02:38.880
I wasn't fooling around when I said

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:41.850
to keep your nose out of police business.

00:02:42.880 --> 00:02:47.020
You're hiding something about
the Blade Children from me,

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:48.280
aren't you?

00:02:49.290 --> 00:02:50.410
No.

00:02:50.820 --> 00:02:55.260
I see. So I'm to be left in the dark...

00:02:58.260 --> 00:03:00.420
I have one more warning for you.

00:03:01.270 --> 00:03:03.290
Hurry or you'll be late.

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:05.400
Oh, crap!

00:03:12.940 --> 00:03:15.280
"Madoka's Birthday"

00:03:25.990 --> 00:03:27.730
Octopus dumplings?

00:03:27.730 --> 00:03:30.350
That reminds me,
I haven't had breakfast...

00:03:41.270 --> 00:03:43.740
<i>Narumi-san! Narumi-san!</i>

00:03:44.040 --> 00:03:46.540
-Good morning!
-Morning.

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:49.050
You look glum for some reason...

00:03:49.050 --> 00:03:50.610
Leave me alone.

00:03:50.610 --> 00:03:55.220
Don't worry. That look is perfect!

00:03:55.220 --> 00:03:57.020
It's proof that things are peaceful!

00:03:57.020 --> 00:03:58.690
What kind of reasoning is that?

00:03:58.690 --> 00:04:02.260
Because when your wrinkles
on your forehead come out

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:04.560
you're tackling a difficult problem!

00:04:07.160 --> 00:04:09.430
See, your wrinkles are out!

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:13.270
Kanone Hilbert!

00:04:13.270 --> 00:04:15.370
Is it really you, Kanone?

00:04:15.370 --> 00:04:16.510
Hello.

00:04:16.510 --> 00:04:18.540
It's nice to see you again, Ryoko.

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:20.410
Have you grown a little more lady-like?

00:04:20.410 --> 00:04:24.280
Suddenly showing up like
this is a real shock.

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:25.850
What've you been doing all this time?

00:04:25.850 --> 00:04:28.120
I traveled by myself for a while.

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:30.090
I see you haven't changed, Kosuke.

00:04:30.090 --> 00:04:32.060
It's good to see you're
still as crabby as ever.

00:04:32.060 --> 00:04:33.890
You're too funny.

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:35.690
You haven't changed either.

00:04:37.060 --> 00:04:39.530
Anyway, it's good to see you again.

00:04:39.530 --> 00:04:40.530
Kanone.

00:04:40.530 --> 00:04:42.530
Did something happen between
you and the Hunters?

00:04:42.530 --> 00:04:43.670
No.

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:47.610
I simply came to Japan to relax
and have octopus dumplings.

00:04:47.610 --> 00:04:49.710
Octopus dumplings?!

00:04:49.710 --> 00:04:52.010
He's no ordinary person if
he came all the way to Japan

00:04:52.010 --> 00:04:54.240
just to eat octopus dumplings...

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:57.820
There's still plenty of time.

00:04:57.820 --> 00:04:59.980
Let's get together sometime.

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:06.690
Kanone! Did you see Rutherford?!

00:05:06.690 --> 00:05:09.090
Apparently celebrities are busy.

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:17.100
I never expected Kanone to show up...

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:19.500
<i>Well, he was the one who told Rutherford</i>

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:22.230
that a large-scale hunt
was about to begin...

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:29.950
It looks like he's a Blade Child too...

00:05:29.950 --> 00:05:31.520
It would seem so.

00:05:31.520 --> 00:05:32.680
Oh, no!

00:05:39.190 --> 00:05:41.120
Way to go, Sayoko!

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:50.660
"Newspaper Office"

00:05:51.670 --> 00:05:55.330
Boxed lunches make me so happy!

00:05:55.610 --> 00:05:58.710
<i>Wow! It's chakin sushi today!</i>

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:01.150
<i>Narumi-san, your cooking
skills are definitely special,</i>

00:06:01.150 --> 00:06:04.150
but the lineup these past few
days has been spectacular!

00:06:04.150 --> 00:06:07.120
Could you stop stealing
people's lunches all the time?!

00:06:07.120 --> 00:06:09.050
Steal? How rude!

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:13.390
Wasn't our deal that I would
let you take naps in here?

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:15.360
Don't mind if I do.

00:06:15.360 --> 00:06:16.930
<i>That reminds me, Narumi-san.</i>

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:19.260
About what happened the other day...

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:24.230
Doesn't it bother you that the
police aren't doing a thing

00:06:24.230 --> 00:06:27.730
about that huge explosion
at the abandoned building?

00:06:28.840 --> 00:06:31.410
<i>I lightly poked Wataya-san about it,</i>

00:06:31.410 --> 00:06:35.140
but he said it's been swept
under the rug as a non-incident.

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:39.380
<i>Madoka-san doesn't seem to
agree with the decision either...</i>

00:06:39.380 --> 00:06:41.940
Have you heard anything at home?

00:06:43.350 --> 00:06:47.590
I'm certain that she's worried about you!

00:06:47.590 --> 00:06:49.130
<i>Ever since the incident with Rio-san,</i>

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:51.960
she's probably been fully
aware that you're involved

00:06:51.960 --> 00:06:53.990
with the Blade Children.

00:06:55.200 --> 00:06:57.600
<i>Narumi-san! Are you listening?!</i>

00:06:57.600 --> 00:06:59.970
Don't tell me you're really asleep?!

00:06:59.970 --> 00:07:02.340
Your mouth never stops, does it?

00:07:02.340 --> 00:07:05.100
My stomach never stops either!

00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:07.940
I humbly accept this!

00:07:10.810 --> 00:07:16.120
<i>Could these so-called Hunters
be inside the police force too?</i>

00:07:30.770 --> 00:07:32.740
Hello.

00:07:32.740 --> 00:07:34.670
<i>Ayumu Narumi-kun.</i>

00:07:35.840 --> 00:07:38.240
How do you know who I am?

00:07:38.240 --> 00:07:41.040
Almost all Blade Children know

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:44.100
that you're Kiyotaka
Narumi's younger brother.

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:47.780
What do you want from me?

00:07:49.850 --> 00:07:54.020
Well, I came to eat Japanese
octopus dumplings, you see...

00:07:54.020 --> 00:07:56.690
You're a good cook, aren't you?

00:08:07.140 --> 00:08:09.440
Sorry for being so sudden.

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:12.680
I look forward to your octopus dumplings!

00:08:17.920 --> 00:08:21.550
Who exactly is that Kanone person?

00:08:21.550 --> 00:08:25.620
We already told you, he's
one of the Blade Children.

00:08:25.620 --> 00:08:28.110
I mean, how does he relate to you?

00:08:28.630 --> 00:08:31.660
He taught us how to protect ourselves.

00:08:31.660 --> 00:08:33.700
Probably the only person to do so.

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:35.670
How to protect yourselves?

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:39.300
In our eyes, he was an angel.

00:08:39.840 --> 00:08:41.570
With black wings.

00:08:44.410 --> 00:08:46.840
I hear you overexerted yourself again.

00:08:46.840 --> 00:08:49.010
Are you all right now?

00:08:49.010 --> 00:08:51.180
I'm fine!

00:08:51.180 --> 00:08:54.790
But this place is no longer safe...

00:08:54.790 --> 00:08:57.090
It's okay. They're not
the kind of people

00:08:57.090 --> 00:08:59.660
who would use the same trick twice.

00:08:59.660 --> 00:09:04.030
<i>I'm sorry I got
Hiyono-san involved, though.</i>

00:09:06.030 --> 00:09:10.230
Well, Little Narumi is probably
the one troubling her the most.

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:12.970
It can't be helped. After all, he...

00:09:12.970 --> 00:09:14.440
Rio.

00:09:14.440 --> 00:09:16.310
We are who we are.

00:09:16.310 --> 00:09:18.040
I know!

00:09:18.040 --> 00:09:22.310
But I have high hopes
for the little brother.

00:09:22.310 --> 00:09:25.250
<i>I want to believe
Kiyotaka-sama when he says</i>

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:30.310
that his brother holds
the key to our fate...

00:09:35.160 --> 00:09:37.560
Yes.

00:09:37.560 --> 00:09:40.330
I see. Alright.

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:44.170
-That was Asazuki.
-What did he say?

00:09:44.170 --> 00:09:46.400
Kanone is in Japan.

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:49.270
I see. So he came to assist us

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:55.840
when he heard that the
Hunters were getting serious!

00:09:57.110 --> 00:10:01.550
Rio. Focus now on getting better.

00:10:01.890 --> 00:10:03.280
Alright...

00:10:30.710 --> 00:10:34.450
<i>Our path will come to an end someday.</i>

00:10:40.560 --> 00:10:43.550
<i>I doubt there will be any
ships to give us a ride...</i>

00:11:38.980 --> 00:11:41.010
She's really late...

00:12:21.930 --> 00:12:22.290
-Did you see her?!
-Yeah! She was great!

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:25.360
-Did you see her?!
-Yeah! She was great!

00:12:25.360 --> 00:12:27.100
Talk about incredible!

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:32.870
Outside the window, kira kira kira ri

00:12:32.870 --> 00:12:36.110
A shooting star...

00:12:36.110 --> 00:12:38.130
<i>Sayoko-san...</i>

00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:42.570
Thank you for your help back then.

00:12:44.550 --> 00:12:46.550
You certainly seem well!

00:12:46.550 --> 00:12:49.880
Yes, thanks to you!

00:12:55.430 --> 00:12:57.730
Who was that?

00:12:57.730 --> 00:13:00.060
<i>Sayoko-san was all smiles!</i>

00:13:00.060 --> 00:13:02.960
That's great! She seems so happy!

00:13:08.740 --> 00:13:10.070
Happy...

00:13:10.070 --> 00:13:12.870
-Let's play tennis some time!
-Yeah!

00:13:28.190 --> 00:13:29.950
Pretty, wouldn't you say?

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:34.870
The color of irises.

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:36.560
Do you like them?

00:13:38.870 --> 00:13:41.390
What do you suppose it means?

00:13:44.110 --> 00:13:47.110
"The happiness of those
who believe," I mean...

00:13:47.110 --> 00:13:49.480
-You're...
-Assistant Inspector!

00:13:49.480 --> 00:13:51.250
Here you are!

00:13:51.250 --> 00:13:53.620
You shouldn't disappear
during work like that!

00:13:53.620 --> 00:13:55.550
I had a tough time finding you!

00:13:59.820 --> 00:14:01.520
What's the matter?

00:14:03.390 --> 00:14:04.950
Nothing...

00:14:07.500 --> 00:14:09.170
No luck.

00:14:09.170 --> 00:14:13.430
I can't find any data on
this Kanone Hilbert fellow.

00:14:13.900 --> 00:14:17.170
Judging from his name,
he could be German...

00:14:18.070 --> 00:14:22.610
Just how many Blade Children
do you suppose there are?

00:14:22.610 --> 00:14:25.280
<i>Eyes Rutherford-san, Kanone-san...</i>

00:14:25.280 --> 00:14:28.650
Do you think there are lots
of similar groups overseas?

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:32.090
<i>Narumi-san! Are you listening?!</i>

00:14:32.090 --> 00:14:35.080
I'm racking my brain here, you know!

00:14:35.860 --> 00:14:38.130
What's the point?

00:14:38.130 --> 00:14:42.200
There's no way for us to
know about their background...

00:14:42.200 --> 00:14:46.240
But we can't change the current
situation unless we learn something!

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:49.070
Do you not care?!

00:14:50.140 --> 00:14:52.340
Of course you do!

00:15:04.490 --> 00:15:08.290
You're popular wherever you go, Eyes.

00:15:18.970 --> 00:15:20.330
You look well.

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:25.680
Have you lost a little weight?

00:15:25.680 --> 00:15:27.470
What do you want?

00:15:29.280 --> 00:15:32.680
Eyes...I'm unsure...

00:15:32.680 --> 00:15:36.950
The path before me has
now split in two...

00:15:54.940 --> 00:15:56.470
Eyes...

00:15:56.470 --> 00:15:59.370
Which path will you choose?

00:16:02.680 --> 00:16:06.510
We don't have much time
to make our choices.

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:19.190
I will not choose the
path of destruction.

00:16:22.170 --> 00:16:27.070
Yeah. There are so many
of us, after all...

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:28.870
But...

00:16:31.040 --> 00:16:35.340
...that's not because you believe
what Kiyotaka said, right?

00:16:37.650 --> 00:16:39.520
<i>After all, it's inconceivable that
our backward-looking Ayumu-kun</i>

00:16:39.520 --> 00:16:43.580
would hold the key to our fate...

00:16:49.460 --> 00:16:51.590
Let's continue this another time!

00:16:59.900 --> 00:17:02.770
Are you a Hunter?!

00:17:02.770 --> 00:17:04.970
If you don't wanna lose a Blade Child

00:17:04.970 --> 00:17:07.210
then do what I say.

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:09.810
I have Sayoko Shiranagatani.

00:17:09.810 --> 00:17:12.580
Four o'clock, in front of
the fountain in Central Park.

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:13.620
If it's me you're after,

00:17:13.620 --> 00:17:16.050
then why do it in roundabout way?

00:17:16.050 --> 00:17:18.820
You're not as easy to take advantage of.

00:17:20.860 --> 00:17:23.630
-Was that a Hunter?
-Yes.

00:17:23.630 --> 00:17:25.600
If there's anything I can do...

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:27.530
No, that's all right.

00:17:28.670 --> 00:17:32.240
I'll help you any time you want, Eyes.

00:17:32.240 --> 00:17:34.030
All you have to do is ask.

00:17:47.780 --> 00:17:50.290
You're home early.

00:17:50.290 --> 00:17:52.260
<i>It is my birthday...</i>

00:17:52.260 --> 00:17:55.020
I should've bought a cake...

00:17:55.020 --> 00:17:56.150
Ayumu.

00:17:59.360 --> 00:18:02.760
Today you're going to tell me everything.

00:18:04.830 --> 00:18:09.040
<i>I've held back ever since Sayoko
Shiranagatani-san's incident,</i>

00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:10.970
but I can't stand it any longer!

00:18:12.610 --> 00:18:16.580
I know you're involved
with the Blade Children.

00:18:16.580 --> 00:18:19.480
I'm not involved with
them because I want to.

00:18:19.480 --> 00:18:24.220
Just tell me what you know!
Stop hiding things from me!

00:18:25.960 --> 00:18:27.680
Did something happen?

00:18:29.160 --> 00:18:30.490
Today...

00:18:45.480 --> 00:18:46.580
Hello?

00:18:46.580 --> 00:18:48.410
Terrible news, Narumi-san!

00:18:48.410 --> 00:18:49.980
Oh, it's you. What is it?

00:18:49.980 --> 00:18:52.350
<i>Sayoko-san has disappeared!</i>

00:18:52.350 --> 00:18:55.020
Her chauffeur came to pick her up

00:18:55.020 --> 00:18:57.020
but she never showed up!

00:18:57.020 --> 00:19:00.020
We searched the campus
but couldn't find her!

00:19:00.020 --> 00:19:02.590
Something must have happened!

00:19:02.590 --> 00:19:05.600
She seemed so happy...

00:19:05.600 --> 00:19:07.600
What if she got involved in something?

00:19:07.600 --> 00:19:09.390
I'm on my way.

00:19:10.370 --> 00:19:11.730
I have to go.

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:13.520
Wait!

00:19:15.810 --> 00:19:17.370
Tell me.

00:19:17.370 --> 00:19:19.780
That call just now, it was
about the Blade Children too,

00:19:19.780 --> 00:19:21.270
wasn't it?

00:19:22.880 --> 00:19:25.250
Say something, will you?!

00:19:26.380 --> 00:19:28.150
<i>If I don't explain everything carefully,</i>

00:19:28.150 --> 00:19:30.250
<i>there's no doubt she'll act recklessly.</i>

00:19:30.250 --> 00:19:32.660
<i>Now that I have reason
to suspect the police,</i>

00:19:32.660 --> 00:19:34.990
<i>I can't afford to let her get involved...</i>

00:19:34.990 --> 00:19:38.220
You understand how I feel, don't you?

00:19:39.630 --> 00:19:41.320
I'll be back soon.

00:19:43.100 --> 00:19:44.430
Fine!

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:57.280
Fancy meeting you here.

00:19:57.280 --> 00:20:00.020
I haven't the time to deal with you.

00:20:00.020 --> 00:20:01.710
Me neither.

00:20:04.390 --> 00:20:06.720
Sayoko Shiranagatani has disappeared!

00:20:08.120 --> 00:20:10.260
Where are you going in such a hurry?!

00:20:10.260 --> 00:20:12.030
It's none of your business!

00:20:12.030 --> 00:20:14.930
There's no question that
this is your problem

00:20:14.930 --> 00:20:17.700
and none of my business.

00:20:17.700 --> 00:20:21.140
She may be one of the Blade Children,

00:20:21.140 --> 00:20:22.830
but she's different from the rest of you!

00:20:35.890 --> 00:20:39.290
<i>What exactly am I doing?</i>

00:20:47.830 --> 00:20:50.130
<i>Sayoko Shiranagatani, I take it?</i>

00:20:50.130 --> 00:20:52.000
<i>If you want things to stay peaceful</i>

00:20:52.000 --> 00:20:56.870
<i>then you'll come to the fountain
in Central Park at 4:00.</i>

00:21:05.810 --> 00:21:11.520
<i>A sweet scent washes into my throat</i>

00:21:11.520 --> 00:21:18.220
<i>and my feelings continuously overflow...</i>

00:21:30.340 --> 00:21:36.380
<i>Don't look at me with that same gaze</i>

00:21:36.380 --> 00:21:42.010
<i>that's like you're following a soccer ball.</i>

00:21:42.010 --> 00:21:47.920
<i>I've already grown used to
my third year at the office,</i>

00:21:47.920 --> 00:21:54.490
<i>but did I lose something instead?</i>

00:21:54.490 --> 00:22:00.230
<i>Those days long ago when we
would talk about anything...</i>

00:22:00.230 --> 00:22:05.440
<i>We're finally old enough now</i>

00:22:05.440 --> 00:22:11.280
<i>to have those slightly awkward
discussions about love.</i>

00:22:11.280 --> 00:22:22.890
<i>A single day seems so long,
but a whole year ends so quickly.</i>

00:22:22.890 --> 00:22:28.660
<i>A whole year seems so short,</i>

00:22:28.660 --> 00:22:34.960
<i>but how well will I be able
to live the rest of my life?</i>

00:22:39.260 --> 00:22:41.060
Time for Hiyono's Useful News Report!

00:22:41.060 --> 00:22:42.800
If the cuckoo doesn't cuckoo,
then let's wait.

00:22:42.800 --> 00:22:45.930
A silent firefly burns itself.

00:22:45.930 --> 00:22:47.770
They say speak to be heard,

00:22:47.770 --> 00:22:49.330
but the one who holds his mouth

00:22:49.330 --> 00:22:51.540
is the one with the strongest feelings.

